id=decemberos-kernel-install
name=DecemberOS kernel installer (action zip)
version=v0.2.0
versionCode=2
author=melissa
description=Flashes the Magisk-patched DecemberOS boot image to the active boot slot, with exact-build + root-survival + backup verification and a dry-run flag (touch /sdcard/Download/decemberos-dryrun). Does not install as a module.
